cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SEION Math+AI Closure Package v2: Recursive Projection of Typed Multilinear Trees, Kernel-Integrated Laws, and Adaptive Rank Allocation"
message: "If this package supports your work, cite this package version and its constituent papers."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Jasso"
    given-names: "Eliuth Chavero"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-01
license: MIT
repository-code: https://example.invalid/seion-math-core
abstract: >
  A six-manuscript package covering recursive orthogonal projection of
  typed multilinear composition trees (proved k/(k-1) error theorem),
  kernel-integrated multilinear operators, numerical/software
  reproducibility studies, and a new adaptive rank-allocation benchmark
  for hierarchical tensor networks, together with a math-closure
  campaign (exact GJI resolution, exact k=2/k=3 closed forms, fixed-tree
  continuum convergence, a verified Markov construction) and a
  self-executed clean-room reproduction.
